  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Сетевой фильтр iFi audio Power Station — Audiophile mains extension block using iFi Active Noise Cancellation II plus passive outlet filtering. Характеристики ниже — только с страницы/листа производителя.</p>\n<ul><li>Noise reduction: >40 dB (>100×)</li><li>Surge protection: Maximum 30,000 A @ 1,000 V/10 μs</li><li>Operating voltage: 90–265 V</li><li>Dimensions: 478 × 96 × 76 mm (L × W × H)</li><li>Weight: 1.98 kg</li></ul>\n<h2>Характеристики производителя</h2>\n<p><strong>Noise reduction</strong>: >40 dB (>100×) · <strong>Surge protection</strong>: Maximum 30,000 A @ 1,000 V/10 μs · <strong>Operating voltage</strong>: 90–265 V · <strong>Dimensions</strong>: 478 × 96 × 76 mm (L × W × H) · <strong>Weight</strong>: 1.98 kg · <strong>Maximum load</strong>: 2,500 W / 10 A maximum (manual).</p>\n<p>Includes polarity/earth diagnostics, supplementary grounding connection and over-voltage/short-circuit cut-off protection.</p>",
